{
  "name": "67 - TOOL - set_company_profile",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Save the facts the email scan needs\n\nThe scan decides which emails matter by matching senders and text against\nthis profile. Without your own domain in it, every email scores the same\nand the update comes back empty.\n\nA blank field keeps whatever was saved before, so the user can correct one\ndetail without repeating all of them. Nothing here is guessed: a wrong\ndomain silently drops every relevant email and nobody notices.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
